You are a senior backend engineer, full-stack developer, messaging systems architect, and UX engineer building the AssureX Claims Management System.

Implement Phase 24: Notifications System.

Build a secure, scalable, event-driven notification platform that delivers timely updates to customers, reviewers, service-center employees, and administrators.

The notification system must support in-app notifications immediately and be designed so email, SMS, and push notifications can be added later without major architectural changes.

---

# Project Context

AssureX is an AI-powered warranty and insurance claims platform.

Users need to be informed when important events occur during the product warranty and claims lifecycle.

Notifications must improve visibility, reduce missed actions, and keep users informed about claim progress.

---

# Objectives

Implement notifications for:

* Warranty nearing expiry
* Missing documents
* Claim submitted
* Additional information requested
* Claim moved to review
* Approved claim
* Rejected claim

Notifications must be role-aware and delivered only to authorized users.

